.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-job-cancel - Stop a one-off job


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container job cancel   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop a one-off job

.PP
Stops a running job (its output so far is kept; the record stays in the list as \fBcancelled\fR). 409 \fBjob_finished\fR when it already ended. Nothing else is deleted.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/containers/{id}/jobs/{job} (operationId cancelContainerJob, scope services_write)


